+- `--bellman-ford`: Works
+- `--metrics`: Works
+- `--all`: Works
+- `--help`: Works
+
+### Metrics ✓
+- Timing accurate
+- Factory creation works
+- Decorator pattern functional
+
+## Performance Comparison
+
