+Distances: 0 4 7 9 10 
+Time: 2 ms
+
+Algorithm: Bellman-Ford
+Distances: 0 4 7 9 10 
+Time: 0 ms
+```
+
+Both produce identical results!
+
+## Backward Compatibility
+
+Existing code still works:
+```java
